  "description": "Kim Cheong-ah wants nothing more than to quit her soul-crushing convenience store job, leave her deadbeat boyfriend, and forget her abusive past. But lacking the funds and the courage, she remains stuck living in a tiny one-room apartment. Her dreary reality takes a chaotic turn when a powerful, slick-talking gangster abruptly crashes into her life. He doesn't care about her debts or her past, but he demands her absolute attention. Cheong-ah knows getting involved with the underworld is dangerous, but the more he pulls her in, the harder it is to think about anyone else.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Sunaemul Danpyeonseon (순애물 단편선) Collection.*",
